From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alice <alice@acme.example>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:12:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): cached user profiles with team and avatar

getUser now takes a required GetUserOptions argument so callers say which
related data they need (include: team, avatar) and whether to bypass HTTP
caches. All callers are updated.

- Move ApiError, auth headers and error-body parsing out of client.ts into
  api/errors.ts (no behaviour change) and add isNotFound.
- Add useProfileCache: stale-while-revalidate profile cache with a 5 minute
  TTL and request de-duplication; ProfilePage uses it.
- Add Avatar and ProfileHeader components.
- server: return avatarUrl when include=avatar is requested.

BREAKING CHANGE: getUser(id) is now getUser(id, opts).
